<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-074-C habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.395872" lon="-120.892295"><name>SC26-074-C</name><cmt>SC26-074</cmt><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 4.1 m relief across 210 m. Terrain C 31/100; not catch probability. Center 91 ft; nearby 89–107 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-054</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.39666165026748" lon="-120.89365069788519"/><trkpt lat="35.39621303284206" lon="-120.8937724657275"/><trkpt lat="35.39621879091108" lon="-120.89410260342453"/><trkpt lat="35.39594846862779" lon="-120.89410963501099"/><trkpt lat="35.39594079107839" lon="-120.89366945290291"/><trkpt lat="35.39567046885803" lon="-120.89367648586287"/><trkpt lat="35.395402066123786" lon="-120.89379356350706"/><trkpt lat="35.39522952822665" lon="-120.89423843002555"/><trkpt lat="35.394959205875395" lon="-120.894245460902"/><trkpt lat="35.39494960953852" lon="-120.89369523996496"/><trkpt lat="35.39467928726926" lon="-120.89370227258156"/><trkpt lat="35.39466776847445" lon="-120.89304201000104"/><trkpt lat="35.395474894385096" lon="-120.89280081562438"/><trkpt lat="35.395482575012295" lon="-120.89324099495434"/><trkpt lat="35.39656194346